{title: Teeth}
{artist: 5 Seconds of Summer}


{key: D#m}
{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D#m]Some days, you're the only thing I know
[D#m]Only thing that's burning when the nights grow cold
[B]Can't look away, can't look away
[B]Beg you to stay, beg you to stay, [C#]yeah
[D#m]Sometimes, you're a stranger in my bed
[D#m]Don't know if you love me or you want me dead
[B]Push me away, push me away
[B]Then beg me to stay, beg me to stay, [C#]yeah
{end_of_verse}


{start_of_bridge: Pre-Chorus}
[D#m]Call me in the morning to a[F#]pologize
[B]Every little [C#]lie gives me [D#]butterflies
[D#m]Something in the way you're looking [F#]through my eyes
[B]Don't know if I'm [C#]gonna make it [D#m]out alive
{end_of_bridge}


{start_of_chorus}
[D#m]Fight so dirty, but your love so sweet
[D#m]Talk so pretty, but your heart got teeth
[B]Late night devil, put your hands on me
[B]And never, never, never ever let go
[D#m]Fight so dirty, but your love so sweet
[D#m]Talk so pretty, but your heart got teeth
[B]Late night devil, put your hands on me
[B]And never, never, never ever let go
{end_of_chorus}


{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D#m]Some days, you're the best thing in my life
[D#m]Sometimes when I look at you, I see my wife
[B]Then you turn into somebody I don't know
[B]And you push me away, push me away, [C#]yeah
{end_of_verse}


